      en: ["Surigao is part of the 'Nickel Capital of the Philippines'.", "The region contains some of the world's highest-grade nickel laterite deposits.", "A major supplier of raw materials for the global stainless steel industry.", "Nickel ore from here is increasingly used in the manufacturing of EV batteries.", "The mining operations are primarily open-pit due to the shallow ore deposits.", "Significant contributor to the export revenues of the Philippines.", "Subject to rigorous environmental audits by the Department of Environment and Natural Resources.", "Mining companies here operate their own private seaports for direct export."],
