      en: ["One of the largest pineapple plantations in the world.", "Spans over 25,000 hectares in Bukidnon province.", "Operated by Del Monte Philippines, Inc.", "Established in the 1920s.", "The volcanic soil is ideal for growing pineapples.", "Includes its own cannery and processing facilities.", "A major global exporter of pineapple products."],
